<title>DENMARK: Den Danske sells Midtbank holding.</title>
<headline>Den Danske sells Midtbank holding.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's largest bank, Den Danske, is to reduce its holding in Midtbank from 27.7 percent to under five percent, a Midtbank statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares would be sold to institutional investors and to local buyers in Midtbank's home area in mid-Jutland, it said.</p>
<p>Neither the Midtbank statement, nor a briefer announcement from Den Danske Bank put a value on the sale.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
